{"3347310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Let's Build Wonders: Galaxy", "steam_appid": 3347310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3357800], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/83831208e5ae354da61aecb35ba61ae9.poster.avif?t=1743472926\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/83831208e5ae354da61aecb35ba61ae9.webm?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/83831208e5ae354da61aecb35ba61ae9.mp4?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every galaxy of the vast universe, there is always the first immigrant ship that sails toward </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the first colony planet, thus marking the beginning of the grand development of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After this, the shadows of pirates and the light of allies intertwine. Legend has it that finding </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and completing the ancient civilization's unfinished miracle structure at the core of the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >galaxy will unlock the mysterious gateway to a new galaxy. Spurred by the undying call of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exploration deep within our hearts, the game embarks on this journey...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/d209b281b4769b1368d13ffffb571b85.poster.avif?t=1743472926\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/d209b281b4769b1368d13ffffb571b85.webm?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/d209b281b4769b1368d13ffffb571b85.mp4?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop more planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with the construction of the first assigned colony planet, continuously explore and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > develop more planets. Develop strategies based on each planet's resource output ratio and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > geographical advantages, select a main planet, and construct a route network to lay a solid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > foundation for the alliance's miracle construction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/9b83b9a2f53a7481c81988af2374454a.poster.avif?t=1743472926\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/9b83b9a2f53a7481c81988af2374454a.webm?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/9b83b9a2f53a7481c81988af2374454a.mp4?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different races have different cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet has a central city. The construction of the city relies on various functional </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buildings which you can choose and place freely. Some buildings are directly related to the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >development direction of the planet. Additionally, you can visit other allies' cities within the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >alliance to learn from their layout arrangements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/b24ea615a7c3a7f821a307537f22c2b4.poster.avif?t=1743472926\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/b24ea615a7c3a7f821a307537f22c2b4.webm?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/b24ea615a7c3a7f821a307537f22c2b4.mp4?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and expand the alliance's territory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an individual player, you can develop additional planets to enhance your economic power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of an alliance, everyone works together to expand influence in the area, integrating </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the powers of other alliances through non-military and non-war means to achieve growth through fusion. The influence range of the star region is also </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one of the important foundations for constructing miracles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And create miracles together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient miracle site is hidden deep within the core of a mysterious galaxy. It requires </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >everyone to find it first, extend your star region territory towards the miracle, and gather </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collective strength. Ultimately, you will build the most magnificent structure in the galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this process, you will inevitably experience a multitude of rich and colorful events.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/83831208e5ae354da61aecb35ba61ae9.poster.avif?t=1743472926\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/83831208e5ae354da61aecb35ba61ae9.webm?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/83831208e5ae354da61aecb35ba61ae9.mp4?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every galaxy of the vast universe, there is always the first immigrant ship that sails toward </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the first colony planet, thus marking the beginning of the grand development of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After this, the shadows of pirates and the light of allies intertwine. Legend has it that finding </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and completing the ancient civilization's unfinished miracle structure at the core of the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >galaxy will unlock the mysterious gateway to a new galaxy. Spurred by the undying call of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exploration deep within our hearts, the game embarks on this journey...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/d209b281b4769b1368d13ffffb571b85.poster.avif?t=1743472926\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/d209b281b4769b1368d13ffffb571b85.webm?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/d209b281b4769b1368d13ffffb571b85.mp4?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop more planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with the construction of the first assigned colony planet, continuously explore and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > develop more planets. Develop strategies based on each planet's resource output ratio and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > geographical advantages, select a main planet, and construct a route network to lay a solid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > foundation for the alliance's miracle construction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/9b83b9a2f53a7481c81988af2374454a.poster.avif?t=1743472926\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/9b83b9a2f53a7481c81988af2374454a.webm?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/9b83b9a2f53a7481c81988af2374454a.mp4?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different races have different cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet has a central city. The construction of the city relies on various functional </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buildings which you can choose and place freely. Some buildings are directly related to the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >development direction of the planet. Additionally, you can visit other allies' cities within the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >alliance to learn from their layout arrangements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/b24ea615a7c3a7f821a307537f22c2b4.poster.avif?t=1743472926\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.a